### Package Delivery API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Calculate Delivery Price
POST {{baseUrl}}/package-delivery/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pickup": {
    "lat": 6.5244,
    "lng": 3.3792
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "lat": 6.4281,
    "lng": 3.4219
  },
  "size": "medium",
  "speed": "express"
}

### 2. Calculate Price - Small Package, Same Day
POST {{baseUrl}}/package-delivery/calculate-price
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pickup": {
    "lat": 6.5244,
    "lng": 3.3792
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "lat": 6.5300,
    "lng": 3.3850
  },
  "size": "small",
  "speed": "same_day"
}

### 3. Request Package Delivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/package-delivery/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "pickupLocation": {
    "lat": 6.5244,
    "lng": 3.3792,
    "address": "123 Victoria Island, Lagos",
    "contactName": "John Doe",
    "contactPhone": "+2348012345678"
  },
  "dropoffLocation": {
    "lat": 6.4281,
    "lng": 3.4219,
    "address": "456 Lekki Phase 1, Lagos",
    "contactName": "Jane Smith",
    "contactPhone": "+2348087654321"
  },
  "packageSize": "medium",
  "deliverySpeed": "express",
  "packageDescription": "Important documents",
  "packageWeight": 2.5,
  "specialInstructions": "Handle with care, fragile contents"
}

### 4. Get Delivery Status (replace {orderId} with actual order ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/package-delivery/{orderId}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Delivery History
GET {{baseUrl}}/package-delivery/history?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Cancel Delivery (replace {orderId} with actual order ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/package-delivery/{orderId}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Rate Delivery (replace {orderId} with actual order ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/package-delivery/{orderId}/rate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "feedback": "Excellent service, very fast delivery!"
}
